docs {
  # Get Active Session

  Retrieves the active user session and user information from the session cookie or authorization header (`GET /api/auth/get-session`).

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Returns `{ "session": { ... }, "user": { ... } }` when authenticated, or `null` when no active session exists.
}

